From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:52:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SetupWizard: drop the diagnostic data question

The services page asked whether to send diagnostic and usage data to
the OS vendor, and stored the answer in LineageSettings'
stats_collection at the end of the wizard. A product without the
statistics uploader has nothing to ask. Remove the row, the privacy
paragraph with its policy URL, the bundle key and the code that stored
the answer, and the strings of all three in every locale.

The page keeps its navigation keys row. A device without a key disabler
would show an empty page, so the page skips itself the way the recovery
update page does, and is disabled for later runs.
